\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   Jesus Christ, our perfect Master;
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 From the days of eternity -
\par Unto ages yet to be born,
\par Has ever our High Priest be
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He is peace unto my spirit,
\par And the foundation of faith
\par He's my sunshine of salvation,
\par Now, 'morrow, eternity.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When my earlier ways of living
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 Brought me nothing but disgrace;
\par He made me to see His glory
\par And the path of salvation;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par It is but His grace and mercy
\par That today I stand alive
\par Yesterday, he showed me His love,
\par And today He does the same.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. If today the foe gets angered,
\par \pard\li270\sl180\slmult0 And people bring me to scorn,
\par He's the one that I heed today;
\par For I know Him as my God.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Today, I carry with pleasure
\par My own cross and follow Him.
\par He is the one whose prophetic deeds
\par Gets fulfilled now and always.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesus when my end gets closer,
\par \pard\li270\sl180\slmult0 And I am about to die \tab 
\par Let me hear then thy sweet message:
\par You'll be in Eden today.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O my Jesus, may I belong
\par Unto that your holy blood;
\par And you'll be Almighty Jesus
\par \pard     To me now and evermore.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

